  "_seedingRules": "Download Cleaner seeding rules per download client, first match wins (list order = priority). A torrent is removed with its files when its ratio reaches maxRatio OR its seeding time reaches maxSeedTime (hours). Values are 2x the tracker's ratio and 10x its seed time. Private torrents on trackers not listed here never match, so they are never removed. Library files are hardlinks and stay.",
